{"book":"leviticus","num":12,"verses":[{"en":"And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,","n":1,"sm":"Aw ia Mose, ua faapea mai,","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Aw"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"Mose,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"","sm":"mai,"}]},{"en":"Speak unto the children of Israel, saying, If a woman have conceived seed, and born a man child: then she shall be unclean seven days; according to the days of the separation for her infirmity shall she be unclean.","n":2,"sm":"Ina fai ane ia i le fanauga a Isaraelu, ia faapea ane, Afai ua to se fafine, ua fanau mai ai foi se tama tane, ona leaga ai lea o ia i aso E fitu; e tusa ma aso e nofo ese ai i le maʻi o fafine, e leaga ai o ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ina"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"ane"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fanauga"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"Isaraelu,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"","sm":"ane,"},{"en":"","sm":"Afai"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"to"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"fafine,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fanau"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"tama"},{"en":"","sm":"tane,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"aso"},{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"fitu;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tusa"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"aso"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"nofo"},{"en":"","sm":"ese"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"maʻi"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"fafine,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia."}]},{"en":"And in the eighth day the flesh of his foreskin shall be circumcised.","n":3,"sm":"E peritomeina foi le tama i le pa‘u o lona tino i le aso valu.","w":[{"en":"","s